This directory distributes Universal Ctags binaries as a separate executable
work. All bundled binaries are official upstream artifacts built from commit
ab95af198f8eaeb6d50dc96e3adf52e769d3e5f0.

Universal Ctags is licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later. Its complete corresponding
source is included at:

  source/universal-ctags-ab95af198f8eaeb6d50dc96e3adf52e769d3e5f0.tar.gz

The official source URL, per-platform release URLs, archive SHA-256 values and
executable SHA-256 values are recorded in manifest.json.

Linux x64/ARM64 and macOS x64/ARM64 come from the official
universal-ctags/ctags-nightly-build 2026.09.16 release. Their upstream package
metadata and dependency notices are preserved under
licenses/official-snapshot/<target>/.

Windows x64 comes from the official universal-ctags/ctags-win32
2026-09-16/p6.2.20260913.0-2-gab95af1 release. Its distributed license texts
are preserved under licenses/win32-x64/.

No bundled Ctags executable is built by this project.
